{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throw Anything: Zombie Invaders</strong> is a wild action defense game where chaos never stops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack it, smash it, and survive against endless waves of zombies in a hilarious physics-based showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956660/extras/dbab4b261e3f7642b19cfb65dc165abc.avif?t=1761642951\" width=1560 height=778 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Easy to play, hard to master</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls let anyone jump right in, but clever tactics and quick reactions are the key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956660/extras/57e52b0620f53ba8c5c2c46d325ab778.poster.avif?t=1761642951\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956660/extras/57e52b0620f53ba8c5c2c46d325ab778.webm?t=1761642951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956660/extras/57e52b0620f53ba8c5c2c46d325ab778.mp4?t=1761642951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udddf Endless mayhem</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hurl everything you see, from everyday objects to crazy weapons, at incoming zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956660/extras/dceb73210f232bfe0239bb5870b836aa.poster.avif?t=17616429